{"4446710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RD Racing", "steam_appid": 4446710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446710/extras/b19bc53ce6a73b9f50f3c3ad5e7a19f4.avif?t=1778763266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446710/extras_big/b19bc53ce6a73b9f50f3c3ad5e7a19f4.webp?t=1778763266 width=1560 height=577 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You were once the best driver on the track. A champion no one could beat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Until the day your own team betrayed you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deprived of everything, you start from scratch. No money, no reputation—only one goal: to return to the top and reclaim what's yours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446710/extras/7460f0d6f2a3011eb257655ff3f99f7b.avif?t=1778763266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446710/extras_big/7460f0d6f2a3011eb257655ff3f99f7b.webp?t=1778763266 width=1560 height=577 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RD Racing is a casual racing game with combat elements where speed and firepower determine who survives. Compete in thrilling top-down races, destroy your rivals, earn money, and upgrade your vehicle to dominate the competition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by the classic Death Rally game, the game brings back the thrill of arcade car combat—but with a modern twist and colorful, cartoonish 3D graphics. Fast-paced races, explosive weapons, and strategic upgrades create chaotic and addictive gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win races. Eliminate your opponents. Build the ultimate fighting machine.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And show everyone that legends never die.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446710/extras/19e13adf471d275b37431e42580b9cf9.avif?t=1778763266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446710/extras_big/19e13adf471d275b37431e42580b9cf9.webp?t=1778763266 width=1560 height=577 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Unlock New Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through races to unlock new stages and increasingly demanding events. The competition gets tougher — and so should you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446710/extras/1e67d844e5e07bc42777b2a68a391f49.avif?t=1778763266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446710/extras_big/1e67d844e5e07bc42777b2a68a391f49.webp?t=1778763266 width=1560 height=577 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning races rewards you with <strong>experience points and money</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new, more powerful cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your existing vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase stronger weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend experience points to unlock and improve skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446710/extras/0262c94b8fd23cbb460ba39124c2f64c.avif?t=1778763266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446710/extras_big/0262c94b8fd23cbb460ba39124c2f64c.webp?t=1778763266 width=1560 height=577 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Visual Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a distinctive <strong>low-poly art style</strong>, enhanced with selected hand-drawn textures that give it a stylized and memorable look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed. Strategy. Firepower. <br>Are you ready to rule the road?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446710/extras/b19bc53ce6a73b9f50f3c3ad5e7a19f4.avif?t=1778763266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446710/extras_big/b19bc53ce6a73b9f50f3c3ad5e7a19f4.webp?t=1778763266 width=1560 height=577 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You were once the best driver on the track. A champion no one could beat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Until the day your own team betrayed you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deprived of everything, you start from scratch. No money, no reputation—only one goal: to return to the top and reclaim what's yours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446710/extras/7460f0d6f2a3011eb257655ff3f99f7b.avif?t=1778763266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446710/extras_big/7460f0d6f2a3011eb257655ff3f99f7b.webp?t=1778763266 width=1560 height=577 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RD Racing is a casual racing game with combat elements where speed and firepower determine who survives. Compete in thrilling top-down races, destroy your rivals, earn money, and upgrade your vehicle to dominate the competition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by the classic Death Rally game, the game brings back the thrill of arcade car combat—but with a modern twist and colorful, cartoonish 3D graphics. Fast-paced races, explosive weapons, and strategic upgrades create chaotic and addictive gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win races. Eliminate your opponents. Build the ultimate fighting machine.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And show everyone that legends never die.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446710/extras/19e13adf471d275b37431e42580b9cf9.avif?t=1778763266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446710/extras_big/19e13adf471d275b37431e42580b9cf9.webp?t=1778763266 width=1560 height=577 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Unlock New Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through races to unlock new stages and increasingly demanding events. The competition gets tougher — and so should you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446710/extras/1e67d844e5e07bc42777b2a68a391f49.avif?t=1778763266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446710/extras_big/1e67d844e5e07bc42777b2a68a391f49.webp?t=1778763266 width=1560 height=577 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning races rewards you with <strong>experience points and money</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new, more powerful cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your existing vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase stronger weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend experience points to unlock and improve skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446710/extras/0262c94b8fd23cbb460ba39124c2f64c.avif?t=1778763266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4446710/extras_big/0262c94b8fd23cbb460ba39124c2f64c.webp?t=1778763266 width=1560 height=577 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Visual Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a distinctive <strong>low-poly art style</strong>, enhanced with selected hand-drawn textures that give it a stylized and memorable look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed. Strategy. Firepower. <br>Are you ready to rule the road?</p>", "short_description": "The betrayed champion returns to the track. Arcade-style combat racing: shoot, drop mines, and destroy your rivals as you race to the finish line. Earn money, upgrade your cars, and weapons to survive increasingly challenging races and regain your position.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Czech, Danish, Finnish, Greek, Spanish - Latin America, Dutch, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Nor